      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The best price came from one of your quotes.  That person rang me and discussed solar power which was invaluable in having additional information from which to make an informed decision.  This person was not local so I contacted them back asking if they did installations in our area but they did not reply so we went elsewhere.Another one of your quotes gave us some valuable information but said they would need to come and visit us to give a firm quote but they did not come when they said they would so we went elsewhere.The experience of getting three quotes / information via your website was very helpful and informative particularly considering that we knew very little about solar power and the information and links your clients sent us was extremely helpful.  However two of the three did not follow through with their quotes.  This was no fault of the website but rather the way they personally conducted their business.",
